# seclegion.list: packages from our own signed [seclegion] repository (tools/build-pkgs), ISO only.
# They join packages.x86_64 but are never resolved against core/extra (tools/container-build.sh):
# the repository is embedded in the ISO at /opt/seclegion/cache/seclegion.
seclegion-keyring
# The installer (seclegion-install, the GTK GUI) and what it reads at run time: seclegion-hwdetect
# supplies seclegion-hwreport (installer page 11) and /usr/share/seclegion/hw/gaming.toml (gaming tier).
seclegion-hwdetect
seclegion-installer
